    {
      "id": "I_kwDOLB-lzc8AAAABNPYQSA",
      "title": "replace flashblocks spec with subblocks spec",
      "author": "geoknee",
      "number": 929,
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/specs",
      "body": "We should only the public facing parts of subblocks. See the docs here:\n\nhttps://docs.optimism.io/op-stack/features/subblocks\nhttps://docs.optimism.io/app-developers/guides/transactions/subblocks-and-gas-usage\n\n\nFor example we should sate the state root doesn't need to be / isn't populated. And cover the wire format and JSON-RPC. It can be very lightweight.\n",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-18T15:29:20Z",
      "closedAt": "2026-09-01T13:41:08Z",
      "state": "CLOSED",
      "commentCount": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "I_kwDOLB-lzc8AAAABPmpygg",
      "title": "specs: interop specify OPContractsManagerMigrator",
      "author": "0xOneTony",
      "number": 937,
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/specs",
      "body": "There is no spec for `OPContractsManagerMigrator` or other spec that mentions the `migrate()`. Add one to following the standard contract spec process, covering `OPContractsManagerMigrationValidator` as well.",
